<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - World Color Press started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - World Color Press started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it initiated coverage of World Color Press Inc as a buy and set a 12-month price target of $27 a share.</p>
<p>-- said expects World Color to earn $1.60 share in 1997 and $1.85 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- World Color Press lost 1/8 to 21-1/4 in midday trading.</p>
</text>
